# Local configuration, generated key material and the demo database.
#
# `.env` and `.env.local` are already covered by the root .gitignore; they are
# repeated so this list reads on its own. The rest are artifacts this package
# produces that the root patterns do not name: the trusted-key file, and the
# SQLite database together with the -wal/-shm sidecars it writes beside it.
.env
.env.local
trusted-keys.json
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
